t":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/cf-configuring-coaching.md","line":172},{"title":"Lists","target":"migration-lists","line":202},{"title":"Skills Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/skills-management.md","line":340},{"title":"activity stream","target":"csm-config-ws-activity-stream","line":380},{"title":"Activate Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/request-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":391},{"title":"Workforce Optimization for Customer Service Reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":444},{"title":"Components installed with Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs","line":625},{"title":"Coaching in Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"explore-coaching-configurable-wfo-cs","line":626},{"title":"Activate Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"request-configurable-wfo-cs","line":627},{"title":"Intelligence","target":"intelligence-csm","line":628},{"title":"User profile page","target":"gamification-ui-user-profile","line":629},{"title":"Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"configurable-wfo-cs","line":630},{"title":"Lists","target":"migration-lists","line":631},{"title":"Activity stream","target":"csm-config-ws-activity-stream","line":632}],"metadata":{"title":"Using Coaching in Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","description":"By using Coaching in Workforce Optimization for Customer Service, you can assess your team's abilities to efficiently resolve cases by reviewing their work at critical moments of customer service.Use Skills Overview to analyze skill data such as how many skills are assigned to users and tasks. You can also see how many experts you have for a particular skill and the overall skill coverage by your teams.Assess the ability of your agents to resolve cases or the quality of their completed tasks.Add or update skills for an agent. You can approve predicted skills if the skill is necessary for the agent to complete assigned tasks. You can also reject a skill if it doesn't apply to the agent.Use Coaching with Learning to train your agents with internal and external learning content. Organize similar content in catalogs. Assign learning tasks and track completion.Create a catalog to organize related content into categories.Create learning tasks for agents to keep track of their learning activities.Add internal courses so that agents can learn new content and enhance their skill set.Add courses from external sources such as Udemy, Pluralsight, or Cornerstone to enable your users to gain skills from external content.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/customer-service-management/coaching-configurable-wfo-cs.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":13,"breadcrumb":["Coaching","Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","Agent management","Use","Customer Service Management"],"tags":["#customer-service-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/customer-service-management/coaching-configurable-wfo-cs.md"},
